{"id":28395,"slug":"the-suitor","title":"The Suitor","year":1963,"country":"France","duration":84,"spine":null,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/28395-the-suitor","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/6d241fb8c8f72f59e482e90332834af0/97qE1nZMiHvGCpq36jZ5SzIrjVih9j_large.jpg","description":"Pierre Etaix’s first feature introduces the droll humor and oddball charm of its unique writer-director-star. As a tribute to Buster Keaton, Etaix fashioned this lovable story of a privileged yet sheltered young man (played by Etaix himself, in a nearly silent performance) who, under pressure from his parents, sets out to find a young woman to marry—though he has a hard time tearing his mind away from the famous singer whose face decorates the walls of his bedroom. ","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Pierre Étaix","slug":"pierre-etaix"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Pierre Étaix","role":"Pierre","slug":"pierre-etaix"},{"actor":"Karin Vesely","role":"Ilka","slug":"karin-vesely"},{"actor":"Claude Massot","role":"Father","slug":"claude-massot"},{"actor":"France Arnell","role":"Stella","slug":"france-arnell"},{"actor":"Laurence Lignières","role":"Laurence","slug":"laurence-lignieres"},{"actor":"Denise Péronne","role":"Mother","slug":"denise-peronne"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Pierre Étaix","slug":"pierre-etaix"},{"role":"Produced by","person":"Paul Claudon","slug":null},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Pierre Étaix","slug":"pierre-etaix"},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Jean-Claude Carrière","slug":"jean-claude-carriere"},{"role":"Cinematography","person":"Pierre Levent","slug":null},{"role":"Music","person":"Jean Paillaud","slug":null}],"pickedBy":[],"related":[360,27526,28454],"setFilms":[],"inSets":[1000947]}